<title>THAILAND: Thailand's National Finance plans merger.</title>
<headline>Thailand's National Finance plans merger.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's National Finance and Securities Plc said on Wednesday that it plans to merge with its affiliate Ekachart Finance and Secuities Plc.</p>
<p>The firm also planned to issue 100 million new shares and 15.735 million new warrants, it said in a statement.</p>
